        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions OMP1017RDDSBR, Decorative Reed and Tassel Handle Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis highly detailed Reed and Tassel Handle Pull from First Impressions has a 7 inch center to center length and measures 17 inches overall. It is available in a wide array of finishes including satin brass, polished chrome, and oil rubbed bronze. Choose from thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, or back-to-back mounting for wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available <a href=\"/products/decorative-reed-and-tassel-appliance-pull-first-impressions-ap-omp1017rddsbr\"><b>First Impressions AP-OMP1017RDDSBR Reed and Tassel Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions OMP1017RDDSBR Decorative Reed and Tassel Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 17\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2.72\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-4/5\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-826-detail.jpg?v=1704354556\" target=\"new\"><b>First Impressions OMP1017RDDSBR Detailed View</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-OLY01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262218\"><b>First Impressions OMP1017RDDSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door pull is handmade assembled in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
